Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|testray.main.component.name|Dynamic Data Lists|
	And these variables
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|testray.main.component.name|Dynamic Data Lists|
		|pageName|Dynamic Data Lists Display Page|
		|portletName|Dynamic Data Lists Display|
Setup: This executes before each scenario 
	Given TestCase set Up Portal Instance
	When User first Login PG
	And Page add
		|pageName|Dynamic Data Lists Display Page|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Dynamic Data Lists Display Page|
	Then Portlet add PG
		|portletName|Dynamic Data Lists Display|
Teardown: This executes after each scenario 
	Given PortalInstances tear Down CP
		|testPortalInstance|TestPropsUtil#get('test.portal.instance')|
Scenario: Add Form Template
Priority: 3
	Given Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Dynamic Data Lists Display Page|
	When DDLList add Via DDL Display PG
	And DDLDataDefinition add Via DDL Display PG
	And DynamicDataMapping add Field
		|field|Boolean|
		|fieldFieldLabel|Boolean|
		|fieldName|Boolean|
	And DynamicDataMapping add Field
		|field|Text|
		|fieldFieldLabel|Text|
		|fieldName|Text|
	And DDLDataDefinition save Via DDL Display PG
	And DDLDataDefinition select Via DDL Display PG
	And DDLList save Via DDL Display PG
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Dynamic Data Lists Display Page|
	And DDLTemplate add Form Template Via DDL Display PG
		|ddlFormTemplateName|Form Template|
	And DynamicDataMapping view Cannot Add Field
		|field|Boolean|
	And DynamicDataMapping view Cannot Add Field
		|field|Text|
	And DynamicDataMapping delete Field
		|fieldFieldLabel|Boolean|
	And DynamicDataMapping view Can Add Field
		|field|Boolean|
	And DynamicDataMapping add Field Form Template Specific
		|field|Separator|
	And DynamicDataMapping add Field Form Template Specific
		|field|Paragraph|
	And DDLTemplate save Form Template Via DDL Display PG
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Dynamic Data Lists Display Page|
	And DDLList select Via DDL Display PG
	And DDLTemplate select Form Template Via DDL Display PG
		|ddlFormTemplateName|Form Template|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Dynamic Data Lists Display Page|
	And DDLRecord add Via DDL Display PG
	And DDLRecord view Field Form Template Specific
		|field|Separator|
	And DDLRecord view Field Form Template Specific
		|field|Paragraph|
		|fieldText|Paragraph|
	And DDLRecord populate Field Text
		|ddlRecordFieldData|Text|
		|fieldFieldLabel|Text|
		|fieldName|Text|
	Then PortletEntry publish
