Scenario: Add List With Documents And Media Field
Priority: 3
##########################################################
The Poshi description element is not supported in the readable syntax. Please update this test.
##########################################################
	When Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Dynamic Data Lists|
	And DDLDataDefinition add CP
		|ddlDataDefinitionName|Data Definition|
	And DynamicDataMapping add Field
		|field|Documents and Media|
		|fieldFieldLabel|Documents and Media|
		|fieldName|DocumentsAndMedia|
	And DDLDataDefinition save
	And Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Dynamic Data Lists|
	And DDLList add CP
		|ddlListName|DDL List|
	And DDLDataDefinition select CP
		|ddlDataDefinitionName|Data Definition|
	And DDLList save
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Dynamic Data Lists Display Page|
	And DDLList select Via DDL Display PG
		|ddlListName|DDL List|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Dynamic Data Lists Display Page|
	And DDLRecord add Via DDL Display PG
		|ddlDataDefinitionName|Data Definition|
		|ddlListName|DDL List|
	And DDLRecord populate Field Documents And Media Choose From Document Library
		|document|Document_1.png|
		|fieldFieldLabel|Documents and Media|
		|fieldName|DocumentsAndMedia|
	And PortletEntry publish
	Then DDLRecord view Via DDL Display PG
		|ddlListName|DDL List|
		|ddlRecordFieldData|Document_1.png|
		|field|Documents and Media|
		|fieldFieldLabel|Documents and Media|
