Scenario: Add Velocity Display Template
Priority: 3
	Given these properties
		|custom.properties|freemarker.engine.restricted.variables=${line.separator}restricted.variables=|
	When these variables
		|ddlDisplayTemplateScript||
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Dynamic Data Lists Display Page|
	And DDLList add Via DDL Display PG
	And DDLDataDefinition add Via DDL Display PG
	And DynamicDataMapping add Field
		|field|Text|
		|fieldFieldLabel|Name|
		|fieldName|Name|
	And DDLDataDefinition save Via DDL Display PG
	And DDLDataDefinition select Via DDL Display PG
	And DDLList save Via DDL Display PG
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Dynamic Data Lists Display Page|
	And DDLRecord add Via DDL Display PG
	And Pause at locator '3000'
	And DDLRecord populate Field Text
		|ddlRecordFieldData|Name1|
		|fieldFieldLabel|Name|
		|fieldName|Name|
	And PortletEntry publish
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Dynamic Data Lists Display Page|
	And DDLTemplate add Display Template Template Via DDL Display PG
		|ddlDisplayTemplateLanguage|Velocity (.vm)|
		|ddlDisplayTemplateName|Velocity Template|
		|ddlDisplayTemplateScript|${ddlDisplayTemplateScript}|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Dynamic Data Lists Display Page|
	And DDLList select Via DDL Display PG
		|ddlListName|List Name|
	And DDLTemplate select Display Template Via DDL Display PG
		|ddlDisplayTemplateName|Velocity Template|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Dynamic Data Lists Display Page|
	Then AssertTextPresent the value 'Name1' at locator '//div[@class='portlet-body']/form'
